现有专业技术人员6905人，其中高级专业技术职务1221人，博士生导师177人，硕士生导师213人。拥有中科院院士1名、双聘院士7名，长江学者、国家杰青、国家优青、科技部中青年创新领军人才等国家级人才60余名。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>● ●</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>教学资源丰富</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>● ●</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>为国家首批临床教学培训示范中心，有国家级虚拟教学示范中心2个，广东省高等教育实验教学示范中心5个。临床技能中心总占地面积 11398 平方米，配套成熟的基础技能训练平台、系统综合实验平台和智慧医学教育平台能够为师生提供全方位的技能培训支持。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/UDPnPAZibAYJpkTKFiaY9eu2qhZrlOeK7vvE69ibSFjw6ze6C3LgZq5YV5z7z2dysDRIglicTR9CkWz8hRcichhrCibg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/nxQKB7niabyVUHlFSmA02SKyaLzYMXcIWmibqM6xe2qQuknG6vaeD0Lr14BosXe34mZuqNZm0UWicdu1v70D8zEpg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/nxQKB7niabyVUHlFSmA02SKyaLzYMXcIWaLzAcovLmkzvvU8WA7GYGpFYOia6qEVRAwDI5g9xAWcEBcNc2BruC4Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>教学资源丰富</span><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>为全国首批住院医师规范化培训基地（30个专业基地），国家首批专科医师培训基地（6个专科基地），其中麻醉科、外科、病理科为国家重点专业基地。是国家医师资格考试实践技能考试与考官培训基地（临床类别），国家医师资格考试实践技能考试广东省首席考官单位。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/nxQKB7niabyVUHlFSmA02SKyaLzYMXcIWZLBjSfUuyUYBvUlO2r3NeicmgMpRWQCvQCia6psKUicCSF1ospHgnUHVg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/nxQKB7niabyVUHlFSmA02SKyaLzYMXcIWZ5ibY9apOR6VKicKFZ3s3icib3vcMQmy26jPhmVgqMlfCAgibPhibSicc5mEw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>● ●</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>科研实力强大</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>● ●</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>拥有国家重点实验室1个，国家临床医学研究中心1个，广东省研究所4个、省部级重点实验室12个、省级工程技术中心6个；先后获国家科技进步二等奖10项、省部级一等奖37项；国家自然科学基金项目连续5年超百项；2024年度 SCI收录论文796篇，全国医疗机构第 18 位，华南第一；高水平研究成果发表在《NEJM》《Cell》《JAMA》《Nature Medicine》《Journal of Hepatology》《LANCET ONCOLOGY》《Lancet Haematology》《JAMA ONCOLOGY》等国际顶级期刊。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>● ●</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>服务社会有力</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>● ●</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>承担各级各类紧急医疗救援保障任务，先后获全军防治非典先进单位、全国抗震救灾英雄集体、全国抗击新冠肺炎疫情先进集体、全国先进基层党组织、全国学雷锋活动示范单位、全国文明单位、全国平安医院建设表现突出集体等荣誉或称号，涌现出了“全国道德模范”、“时代楷模”骆抗先教授为代表的一批典型人物。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>03</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/cT6UQAPI8Uiaibaf7KKMibukESVa2cUP2AnecXaJdhgpM1bZJx3Jf1iaMFzbhusMYPYVDNYribCQ7ib0F40Nza76Tzbw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>“游学南医·一临”</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>科研体验行</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/cT6UQAPI8Uiaibaf7KKMibukESVa2cUP2AnKicLFcdJHbthrXO2kDAY7wcib62NoicgxHcUSsWeibriaXhMvwic6IRNycqw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/cT6UQAPI8Uiaibaf7KKMibukESVa2cUP2AnKicLFcdJHbthrXO2kDAY7wcib62NoicgxHcUSsWeibriaXhMvwic6IRNycqw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>为搭建全国各高校优秀学生学习交流平台，拟举办2025年“游学南医·一临”科研体验行活动，具体安排如下：</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/cT6UQAPI8Uiaibaf7KKMibukESVa2cUP2AnKicLFcdJHbthrXO2kDAY7wcib62NoicgxHcUSsWeibriaXhMvwic6IRNycqw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请资格</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）热爱社会主义祖国，拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，具有良好的品行，无违法违纪行为。</span><span><br/></span><span>（二）临床医学、儿科学、医学影像学（五年）、麻醉学（五年）、精神病学专业2026年应届本科毕业生。</span><span><br/></span><span>（三）本科阶段总成绩排名在该校同年级本专业前列，报名学生能获得所在院校推免资格者优先。</span><span><br/></span><span>（四）有科研相关经历、发表论文、申请专利或在科技创新研究方面有突出表现者优先，在省级以上临床技能竞赛等重大活动中获奖者优先。</span><span><br/></span><span>（五）具有良好的外语水平，满足下列条件之一：1.六级≧425分；2.雅思≧6.0分；3.托福≧90分。获国家级英语比赛三等奖以上奖项者优先。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>日程安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间：</span></strong><span>即日起至2025年6月23日18:00前</span><span><br/></span><strong><span>活动时间：</span></strong><span>2025年7月3日开幕（具体时间另行通知）</span><span><br/></span><strong><span>活动内容：</span></strong><span>报到、开幕式、学科交流（具体安排另行通知）</span><span><br/></span><strong><span>学员人数：</span></strong><span><br/></span></p><p><span>100-120人（南方医科大学南方医院）</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>30-35人（南方医科大学皮肤病医院）</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名流程和报名材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>（一）登记报名信息并加群</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>有意向申报者（含拟报皮肤病医院者）请扫码填写报名信息，加入咨询QQ群（QQ群号：1001498011），入群时需备注“姓名-所在高校-体验行活动报名”。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0HeXx8kppYbW6j6ww0NdFW6xuYeg5VObFYeJtqLkUo6Richs63lcLiaibba8dsMicjnpUqibSV4S0qncAA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/nxQKB7niabyVUHlFSmA02SKyaLzYMXcIWZqBYgRrvBwDz7mEG5uocvYWoxk6JSW63Kq5Lxa8vHhbvpYHic3Yj7Zg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0HeXx8kppYbW6j6ww0NdFW6xuYeg5VObFYeJtqLkUo6Richs63lcLiaibba8dsMicjnpUqibSV4S0qncAA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>2025年南方医科大学</span></strong></span></p><p><strong><span><span>“游学南医·一临”科研体验行</span></span></strong></p><p><span><strong><span>活动报名信息登记表</span></strong></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>（二）提交报名材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>请按下列排序将材料扫描整合一个文档，以PDF格式提交电子版，最终确认报名以收到邮件回复为准。受理邮箱地址：nfyyjwc@qq.com（报名南方医科大学皮肤病医院单独发送至smudhkjk@163.com），电子邮件命名为：“游学南医·一临”科研体验行－姓名－在读院校－联系电话-报考专业（未按要求提交材料不予受理）。需交材料如下：</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.南方医科大学2025年“游学南医·一临”科研体验行活动申请表电子版（附件1）</span><span><br/></span><span>2.本科阶段成绩单及同年级总成绩排名表扫描版（由教务部门或院系盖章）</span><span><br/></span><span>3.英语水平证明扫描版（四六级或雅思托福证书等）</span><span><br/></span><span>4.学生所在院校专任教师（有副高及以上职称）推荐信（附件2）</span><span><br/></span><span><span>以上1-3为必须提交项，有推荐信者同等条件下优先考虑</span></span><span>。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>申请说明</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）参与人员从报名者中选拔，入选后需全程参与相关活动，中途不得退出。</span><span><br/></span><span>（二）申请者所提供的各种信息和材料必须真实，如有弄虚作假，一经查实，取消资格。</span><span><br/></span><span>（三）报名专业见附件3，</span><span><span>报名单位为南方医科大学南方医院或南方医科大学皮肤病医院</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><br/></span><span>（四）南方医院研究生导师简介可通过“专业名称”或“导师姓名”在大学导师信息网进行搜索：</span><span><br/></span><span>https://yjsxt.smu.edu.cn/Open/TutorList.aspx</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>活动支持</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）广州市外院校的学员活动期间提供免费食宿，交通费自理。</span></p><p><span>（二）为学员提供活动礼品（南医文创纪念品礼包、证书等）。</span><span><br/></span><span>（三）活动期间表现优秀者颁发“优秀学员”证书。相关政策参照学校要求执行。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>联系方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>联系人：谭老师、向老师</span><span><br/></span><span>南方医院报名邮箱：nfyyjwc@qq.com</span><span><br/></span><span>皮肤病医院报名邮箱：smudhkjk@163.com</span><span><br/></span><span>QQ群：1001498011</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>● ●</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>附件</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>● ●</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4Cq6jTU-wyZGK2EVwDHzpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：南方医科大学2025年优秀大学生“游学南医·一临”科研体验行活动申请表.docx</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4Cq6jTU-wyZGK2EVwDHzpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：专家推荐信.doc</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4Cq6jTU-wyZGK2EVwDHzpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件3：南方医科大学2025年“游学南医·一临”科研体验行活动报名目录.xlsx</a></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/lB1oaPhdMNvxZ67rEjeQWUFqwCxiacBblWHRAxzuoMfYPQXETZ7Y5bsGSLBPy2QGDKIbia74ruAWgJXhWkMlGgkA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/nxQKB7niabyVUHlFSmA02SKyaLzYMXcIW6STVD8a8xTwCTlYq3dicCaib1DZ0Y98pEaVia7WvstWmJXWHTJyZ4CScw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>南方医院教务处</span></p><p><span>微信号｜nfyy_jwc</span></p><p><span>关注我们</span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/lB1oaPhdMNvxZ67rEjeQWUFqwCxiacBblWHRAxzuoMfYPQXETZ7Y5bsGSLBPy2QGDKIbia74ruAWgJXhWkMlGgkA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/nxQKB7niabyXmRTAOa5B6CM9cNkHh6ttZM01CbE1YgXxDtfRkmglddRtcC8htRiagqB44FBThqKguv7Ufqp0rdTA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>南方医院教务处</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>官方微信订阅号 </span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>微信号丨nfyyjwc</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>关注我们</span></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"ca67db5cc2b77965783317483a1af708367f8522c5b2e0fe7592ead42cbb5ced","te